<title>USA: Redwood Trust ups qtly div to $0.60/shr.</title>
<headline>Redwood Trust ups qtly div to $0.60/shr.</headline>
<dateline>MILL VALLEY, Calif 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Redwood Trust Inc said it declared its quarterly dividend to $0.60 per share, up 46 percent from the previous quarter's dividend.</p>
</text>
